flowchart LR
    Start([POST /api/chat/read]) --> Guard{Valid request and authorized PART?}
    Guard -->|No| Denied[Return safe validation or access error]
    Guard -->|Yes| Position{Message belongs to authorized conversation?}
    Position -->|No| Missing[Return safe position unavailable]
    Position -->|Yes| Upsert[Atomic insert or conflict update]
    Upsert --> Compare[Advance only for a newer tuple]
    Compare --> Result{Row changed?}
    Result -->|Yes| Advanced[advanced true]
    Result -->|No| Stable[Keep current cursor, advanced false]
    Advanced --> Counts[Derive unread and mention counts]
    Stable --> Counts
    Counts --> Still{Conversation still authorized?}
    Still -->|No| Rollback[Raise access-changed and roll back]
    Still -->|Yes| Return[Return cursor and count-only result]
    Return --> Finish([Badges reconcile from server state])

    Tuple[Row lock plus created_at and message id comparison] -.-> Compare
    Constraint[Composite participant and conversation PK] -.-> Upsert
    History[Mention rows are preserved, not deleted] -.-> Counts

